  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong style=\"font-weight:normal\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-3f853735-7fff-74b2-43c3-8c04e07b3e3d\">Whether a state-run operation, or private armies employed by the megacorporations, those with a military background know that the concerns of those on the streets only exist because there are streets to be concerned about. You've trained since you were young, studied the history of war, learned basic survival techniques, including how to stay alive on the battlefield. You are not a civilian, you are a soldier... or at least, you were. What was it that made you leave?</strong></p><hr /><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Skill Proficiencies: </strong>Athletics, your choice of History or Intimidation</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Tool Proficiencies: </strong>Two of Vehicles (land), Vehicles (water), or Vehicles (air)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt\"><strong>Languages: </strong>None</p><p><strong>Equipment: </strong>An insignia of rank, an old uniform from your unit, a set of common clothes, a handgun, and a cryptostick with 1000 cp.</p><p><strong>Feature:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.cyberpunk-5e.cyberpunk-backgrounds.Item.xAq5R1A5KMNc4qWO]{Military Rank}</p>",
